Description: Mobile app rules and patterns
Globs: mobile/**/*

# Mobile App Rules - Clean Scapes P4P System

## Critical Requirement: Bilingual Support
- **MUST** support English and Spanish
- Use `react-i18next` for translations
- Store language preference in AsyncStorage
- Allow language toggle in Profile screen
- All user-facing text must be translated

## Component Structure
- Use functional components with hooks
- Separate screens and components
- Use React Context for global state (auth, language)
- Keep components focused and reusable

## Navigation
- Use React Navigation
- Stack Navigator for auth flow
- Bottom Tab Navigator for main app (Home, History, Profile)
- Stack Navigator nested in tabs for detail screens

## Styling
- Use React Native StyleSheet
- Create consistent design system
- Use responsive dimensions (avoid hardcoded values)
- Follow platform conventions (iOS vs Android)

## State Management
- Use React Context API for:
  - Authentication state (`AuthContext`)
  - Language preference (`LanguageContext`)
- Use local state (`useState`) for:
  - Form inputs
  - Screen-specific UI state
- Use `useEffect` for data fetching

## API Integration
- Use `services/api.js` for all API calls
- Include authentication token in headers
- Store token in AsyncStorage
- Handle loading states
- Display error messages to users
- Handle network errors gracefully

## Data Persistence
- Use AsyncStorage for:
  - Authentication token
  - Language preference
  - User profile data (cache)
- Clear storage on logout

## Screen Patterns

### Dashboard Screen
- Show yesterday's performance score prominently
- Display star rating (1-5 stars based on efficiency)
- Show payout breakdown (base, bonus, penalties, total)
- Quick stats: hours, jobs, on-time, lunch
- Buttons to view breakdown and history

### Breakdown Screen
- Show detailed pay calculation
- Job-by-job efficiency breakdown
- Visual indicators (✅ or ⚠️)
- Base pay, bonuses, penalties clearly separated
- Final total highlighted

### History Screen
- Show last 30 days of performance
- Performance trend chart
- Average, best day, total earned
- List of recent days with scores
- Tap to view details

### Profile Screen
- User information display
- Language toggle (EN/ES)
- Settings options
- Help/FAQ link
- Logout button

## Charts
- Use react-native-chart-kit or similar
- Make charts responsive
- Show loading states
- Include legends and labels

## Error Handling
- Show user-friendly error messages
- Handle network errors (offline scenarios)
- Provide retry options
- Log errors for debugging

## Loading States
- Show loading spinners for async operations
- Use skeleton screens for better UX
- Disable buttons during submission

## Notifications
- Show notification banner on dashboard
- Display unread count badge on home tab
- Mark notifications as read when viewed
- Link notifications to relevant screens

## Platform Considerations
- Test on both iOS and Android
- Handle platform-specific differences
- Use platform-appropriate UI components
- Follow platform design guidelines

## Performance
- Optimize image loading
- Use React.memo for expensive components
- Avoid unnecessary re-renders
- Lazy load screens when possible

## Accessibility
- Include accessibility labels
- Support screen readers
- Ensure touch targets are large enough
- Maintain color contrast

## Translation Files
- `i18n/en.json` - English translations
- `i18n/es.json` - Spanish translations
- Keep structure identical between files
- Use translation keys consistently
